{"html":"<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n  <head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\r\n    <title>Comet Native 与 0.4.0 Classic 对比报告</title>\r\n    <style>\r\n      :root {\r\n        color-scheme: light;\r\n        --paper: #ffffff;\r\n        --canvas: #f3f1ec;\r\n        --ink: #191817;\r\n        --muted: #69645d;\r\n        --line: #cbc6bc;\r\n        --grid: #e8e4dc;\r\n        --native: #176b87;\r\n        --native-soft: #dcebf0;\r\n        --classic: #595b60;\r\n        --classic-soft: #e7e7e5;\r\n        --pass: #28745c;\r\n        --warn: #a5642b;\r\n        --fail: #a33a32;\r\n        --paper-font: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, \"Songti SC\",\r\n          \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", serif;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      * {\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      html {\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      body {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n        color: var(--ink);\r\n        font: 15px/1.55 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      main {\r\n        width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 40px));\r\n        margin: 20px auto 52px;\r\n        padding: 52px 62px 64px;\r\n        background: var(--paper);\r\n        border: 1px solid #ddd8cf;\r\n        border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      header.report-header {\r\n        max-width: 860px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto 34px;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .kicker {\r\n        margin: 0 0 12px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em;\r\n        text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h1 {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 48px);\r\n        line-height: 1.12;\r\n        letter-spacing: -0.025em;\r\n        text-wrap: balance;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .dek {\r\n        max-width: 760px;\r\n        margin: 20px auto 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        text-wrap: pretty;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .meta {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        gap: 8px 18px;\r\n        margin-top: 20px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font: 12px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle {\r\n        position: fixed;\r\n        top: 18px;\r\n        right: 18px;\r\n        z-index: 20;\r\n        display: inline-flex;\r\n        padding: 3px;\r\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\r\n        border: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n        border-radius: 999px;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(25, 24, 23, 0.12);\r\n        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle a {\r\n        padding: 6px 12px;\r\n        border-radius: 999px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\r\n        text-decoration: none;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle a.is-active {\r\n        background: var(--ink);\r\n        color: #fffdf8;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      section {\r\n        margin-top: 36px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h2 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 7px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-size: 18px;\r\n        line-height: 1.25;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h3 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 5px;\r\n        font-size: 15px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      p {\r\n        margin: 0 0 14px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      code {\r\n        padding: 0.08rem 0.24rem;\r\n        background: #f2f0eb;\r\n        font: 0.92em/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric {\r\n        min-width: 0;\r\n        padding: 18px 16px 16px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric:last-child {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-label {\r\n        min-height: 36px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        line-height: 1.35;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-value {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--native);\r\n        font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        line-height: 1;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-context {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure {\r\n        margin-top: 22px;\r\n        padding-top: 14px;\r\n        border-top: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-head {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: baseline;\r\n        justify-content: space-between;\r\n        gap: 16px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-title {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: 15px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-note {\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        text-align: right;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .legend {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n        gap: 8px 18px;\r\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .legend span::before {\r\n        display: inline-block;\r\n        width: 18px;\r\n        height: 3px;\r\n        margin: 0 7px 3px 0;\r\n        background: var(--legend-color);\r\n        content: \"\";\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        gap: 19px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-row {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr) 58px;\r\n        gap: 12px;\r\n        align-items: center;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-label {\r\n        font-size: 13px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .bar-pair {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        gap: 5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .track {\r\n        height: 10px;\r\n        background: repeating-linear-gradient(\r\n          to right,\r\n          transparent 0,\r\n          transparent calc(25% - 1px),\r\n          var(--grid) calc(25% - 1px),\r\n          var(--grid) 25%\r\n        );\r\n        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .bar {\r\n        width: var(--value);\r\n        height: 100%;\r\n        min-width: 2px;\r\n        background: var(--color);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-value {\r\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\r\n        text-align: right;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .caption {\r\n        margin: 14px 0 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        text-wrap: pretty;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .table-scroll {\r\n        overflow-x: auto;\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      table {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        border-collapse: collapse;\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th,\r\n      td {\r\n        padding: 8px 10px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        text-align: left;\r\n        vertical-align: middle;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th {\r\n        border-bottom: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        white-space: nowrap;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      td.number,\r\n      th.number {\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      tbody tr:last-child td {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score {\r\n        display: inline-flex;\r\n        min-width: 46px;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        padding: 3px 8px;\r\n        color: white;\r\n        background: var(--pass);\r\n        font: 700 11px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score.partial {\r\n        background: var(--warn);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score.low {\r\n        background: var(--fail);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        gap: 0;\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item {\r\n        padding: 15px 18px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-child(2n) {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout {\r\n        margin-top: 24px;\r\n        padding: 18px 20px;\r\n        background: #f4f2ed;\r\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout strong {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: #44413d;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      @media (max-width: 760px) {\r\n        main {\r\n          width: 100%;\r\n          margin: 0;\r\n          padding: 30px 20px 42px;\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n          border-left: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric-grid {\r\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(2) {\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-grid {\r\n          grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-item,\r\n        .method-item:nth-child(2n),\r\n        .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-item:last-child {\r\n          border-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .figure-head {\r\n          display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .figure-note {\r\n          margin-top: 5px;\r\n          text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .chart-row {\r\n          grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr) 50px;\r\n          gap: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    </style>\r\n  </head>\r\n  <body>\r\n    <nav class=\"language-toggle\" aria-label=\"报告语言\">\r\n      <a class=\"is-active\" href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-040-20260716/report.html\" target=\"_self\" aria-current=\"page\">中文</a>\r\n      <a href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-040-20260716/report-en.html\" target=\"_self\" lang=\"en\">English</a>\r\n    </nav>\r\n    <main>\r\n      <header class=\"report-header\">\r\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Comet Eval · Aligned Pass@3 Study</p>\r\n        <h1>Native 与 0.4.0 Classic 对比报告</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"dek\">\r\n          相同的 16 个业务任务、每个任务 3 次运行。业务验证器保持一致，workflow\r\n          验证器按两种模式各自的契约设置。\r\n        </p>\r\n        <div class=\"meta\">\r\n          <span>Native · 2026-07-16</span>\r\n          <span>0.4.0 Classic · 2026-07-04—05</span>\r\n          <span>96 runs total</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </header>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"headline\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"headline\">核心数据</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"metric-grid\">\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">Native strict pass@1</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">95.83%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">0.4.0：89.58%，+6.25 pp</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">两种模式 pass@3</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">100%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">16/16 任务至少成功一次</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">Native pass^3</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">87.5%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">0.4.0：75%，+12.5 pp</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">平均累计模型耗时</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">−47.8%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">184.0s vs 352.4s</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"reliability\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"reliability\">pass@k 实验结果</h2>\r\n        <article class=\"figure\">\r\n          <div class=\"figure-head\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"figure-title\">图 1. pass@1、pass@3 与 pass^3</h3>\r\n            <span class=\"figure-note\">百分比，越高越好</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"图例\">\r\n            <span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">Native</span>\r\n            <span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">0.4.0 Classic</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Native 与 0.4.0 Classic 可靠性指标对比\">\r\n            <div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@1</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 95.83%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 89.58%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">95.8<br />89.6</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@3</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100<br />100</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass^3</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 87.5%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 75%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">87.5<br />75.0</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <p class=\"caption\">\r\n            <code>pass@3</code> 只要求三次中至少一次成功；<code>pass^3</code>\r\n            要求三次全部成功。两者并列，才能同时看到能力覆盖与重复运行稳定性。\r\n          </p>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"efficiency\">完成任务的执行效率</h2>\r\n        <p>\r\n          只统计 Native 与 Classic 都通过的 41 组相同任务重复，避免把提前失败误当成低消耗。模型启动/恢复次数表示首次启动以及用户回答或冷恢复后的再次进入；Agent\r\n          轮次是这些调用内部的累计轮次。\r\n        </p>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll\">\r\n          <table>\r\n            <thead>\r\n              <tr><th>指标</th><th class=\"number\">Native</th><th class=\"number\">0.4.0 Classic</th><th class=\"number\">Native 差异</th></tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr><td>模型启动/恢复次数</td><td class=\"number\">1.80</td><td class=\"number\">2.85</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−36.8%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>Agent 轮次</td><td class=\"number\">39.02</td><td class=\"number\">91.66</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−57.4%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>工具调用</td><td class=\"number\">36.22</td><td class=\"number\">81.80</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−55.7%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>累计模型耗时</td><td class=\"number\">180.8s</td><td class=\"number\">343.9s</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−47.4%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>非缓存输入 Token</td><td class=\"number\">16,647</td><td class=\"number\">74,903</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−77.8%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>输出 Token</td><td class=\"number\">5,471</td><td class=\"number\">13,788</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−60.3%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>总 Token（包含缓存读取）</td><td class=\"number\">891,631</td><td class=\"number\">3,840,975</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−76.8%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>模型成本</td><td class=\"number\">$0.658</td><td class=\"number\">$2.638</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−75.1%</span></td></tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p class=\"caption\">\r\n          Native 48/48 条轨迹的平均峰值上下文为 34,771 Token，中位峰值 34,568，最大值 42,012，平均占 200k 窗口的 17.4%。Classic 只有 9/48\r\n          保存了同等粒度的逐消息 usage，因此不计算 workflow 间的上下文提升比例。\r\n        </p>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"latency\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"latency\">修正后的模型耗时</h2>\r\n        <article class=\"figure\">\r\n          <div class=\"figure-head\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"figure-title\">图 2. 每次样本的累计原始 result duration</h3>\r\n            <span class=\"figure-note\">秒，越低越好</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"图例\">\r\n            <span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">Native</span>\r\n            <span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">0.4.0 Classic</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Native 与 0.4.0 Classic 修正耗时对比\">\r\n            <div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">平均值</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 45.99%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 88.09%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">184.0<br />352.4</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">中位数</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 43.62%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 82.05%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">174.5<br />328.2</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <p class=\"caption\">\r\n            修正口径会累加一次样本所有顶层 <code>result.duration_ms</code>，而不是只取最后一段结果；不包含 Docker\r\n            准备和业务验证器运行时间。0.4.0 有 47 个可观测耗时样本，另 1 次在产生 result 前失败。\r\n          </p>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"matrix\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"matrix\">任务级稳定性矩阵</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll\">\r\n          <table>\r\n            <thead>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <th>任务</th>\r\n                <th class=\"number\">Native</th>\r\n                <th class=\"number\">0.4.0 Classic</th>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr><td>agent-memory-routing</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>api-cache-ttl</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>cross-file-refactor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>dependency-confusion</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>fix-median</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>framework-selection</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>full-workflow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>graph-execution-review</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score low\">1/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>human-approval-flow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>layered-streaming-fix</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>noise-distractor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>observability-env-template</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>perf-dedupe</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>persistence-threading</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>refactor-counter</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>robust-config</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p class=\"caption\">\r\n          Native 有 14/16 个任务三次全部通过；0.4.0 Classic 为 12/16。两种模式均覆盖全部 16 个任务的至少一次成功。\r\n        </p>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"failures\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"failures\">失败归因</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"method-grid\">\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>Native：2 次 workflow 证据失败</h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              两次业务验证均通过，但 <code>native_state</code> 判断 brief、specification 或 verification\r\n              证据不完整。因此它们计入 strict failure。\r\n            </p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>0.4.0：1 次业务失败</h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              <code>full-workflow</code> 一次运行未实现要求的 <code>--sentences</code> 功能，是本组唯一明确的业务验证失败。\r\n            </p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>0.4.0：4 次流程契约失败</h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              其余失败来自依赖 Skill 未观测到、主 Comet Skill 未调用，或只完成 3/5 个 Classic 阶段。\r\n            </p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>Judge 不进入本次结论</h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              Native 历史报告中的定性 Judge 文本曾读到 transport 文件。本页只使用硬验证、样本通过状态和原始 result 耗时。\r\n            </p>\r\n          </article>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"boundary\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"boundary\">比较边界</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"method-grid\">\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>对齐的部分</h3>\r\n            <p>相同 16 个业务任务、相同业务验证器和相同 3 次重复规模。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>刻意不同的部分</h3>\r\n            <p>Native 检查 Shape—Build—Verify—Archive 证据；Classic 检查五阶段、OpenSpec 和依赖 Skill 契约。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>提示词去偏</h3>\r\n            <p>任务中的 Classic 术语被明确映射到 Native 工作流，保留业务要求，但不要求 Native 模仿 Classic 产物。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>时间窗口限制</h3>\r\n            <p>0.4.0 来自历史运行，Native 来自当前并发运行。耗时差异是强方向性信号，不是完全受控的因果结论。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>Native 数据源</h3>\r\n            <p><code>experiment_20260716_104344</code>：48/48 included，全部为 high confidence。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\">\r\n            <h3>0.4.0 数据源</h3>\r\n            <p><code>combined_comet_workflow_full_k3_20260705_v3_rerun_failed</code>：48/48 included，全部 flagged、medium confidence。</p>\r\n          </article>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"callout\">\r\n          <strong>结论</strong>\r\n          <p>\r\n            在这组对齐样本中，Native 保留了 100% 的任务级 <code>pass@3</code>，同时提高了单次严格通过率和三次全通过率，并显著缩短累计模型耗时。它说明面向强模型的轻执行路径是可行的；它不意味着 Classic 应被移除。Classic 仍服务于需要更强过程约束和分步引导的模型与任务。\r\n          </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n    </main>\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\n"}